{
  "_nota": "Ventana para redactar el mensaje antes de abrir WhatsApp. El nodo con el comportamiento ES la ventana e intercepta TODOS los enlaces a wa.me de la página: cada botón conserva el mensaje propio de su seccion, porque la ventana lo lee del enlace que la abrio. El campo de texto y la casilla no van en el marcado a proposito: el sanitizador bloquea textarea e input para que un documento importado no pueda traer un formulario falso, asi que los crea el comportamiento dentro de los huecos. Al enviar emite un evento medible ANTES de salir del sitio, que es la razon de existir de todo esto: un clic que se va a WhatsApp se mide mal, sobre todo en telefono.",
  "mode": "append",
  "styles": [
    {
      "selector": ".wa-ventana",
      "style": {
        "position": "fixed",
        "right": "24px",
        "bottom": "92px",
        "left": "auto",
        "top": "auto",
        "width": "min(370px, calc(100vw - 32px))",
        "background-color": "#FFFFFF",
        "border-radius": "16px",
        "overflow": "hidden",
        "z-index": "9100",
        "box-shadow": "rgba(40, 35, 20, 0.30) 0px 22px 60px",
        "opacity": "0",
        "transform": "translateY(12px) scale(0.98)",
        "pointer-events": "none",
        "transition": "opacity .2s ease, transform .2s ease",
        "font-family": "Montserrat, sans-serif"
      }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".wa-ventana.is-open",
      "style": { "opacity": "1", "transform": "none", "pointer-events": "auto" }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".wa-ventana__cabecera",
      "style": {
        "display": "flex",
        "align-items": "center",
        "gap": "11px",
        "padding-top": "14px",
        "padding-right": "16px",
        "padding-bottom": "14px",
        "padding-left": "16px",
        "background-color": "#5E6B4A",
        "color": "#FFFFFF"
      }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".wa-ventana__avatar",
      "style": {
        "width": "38px",
        "height": "38px",
        "border-radius": "50%",
        "background-color": "rgba(255,255,255,0.18)",
        "display": "flex",
        "align-items": "center",
        "justify-content": "center",
        "flex-grow": "0",
        "flex-shrink": "0",
        "font-size": "12px",
        "font-weight": "700",
        "letter-spacing": "0.5px"
      }
    },
    { "selector": ".wa-ventana__quien", "style": { "flex-grow": "1", "min-width": "0" } },
    {
      "selector": ".wa-ventana__nombre",
      "style": { "font-size": "13px", "font-weight": "700", "margin-top": "0px", "margin-right": "0px", "margin-bottom": "0px", "margin-left": "0px", "line-height": "1.3", "color": "#FFFFFF" }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".wa-ventana__estado",
      "style": { "font-size": "11px", "margin-top": "1px", "margin-right": "0px", "margin-bottom": "0px", "margin-left": "0px", "opacity": "0.82", "line-height": "1.3", "color": "#FFFFFF" }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".wa-ventana__cerrar",
      "style": {
        "background-color": "transparent",
        "border-style": "none",
        "border-width": "0px",
        "color": "#FFFFFF",
        "cursor": "pointer",
        "padding-top": "4px",
        "padding-right": "4px",
        "padding-bottom": "4px",
        "padding-left": "4px",
        "border-radius": "50%",
        "opacity": "0.8",
        "line-height": "0"
      }
    },
    { "selector": ".wa-ventana__cerrar:hover", "style": { "opacity": "1", "background-color": "rgba(255,255,255,0.14)" } },
    {
      "selector": ".wa-ventana__cuerpo",
      "style": { "padding-top": "16px", "padding-right": "16px", "padding-bottom": "16px", "padding-left": "16px", "background-color": "#F2EFE7" }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".wa-ventana__saludo",
      "style": {
        "background-color": "#FFFFFF",
        "border-top-left-radius": "4px",
        "border-top-right-radius": "14px",
        "border-bottom-right-radius": "14px",
        "border-bottom-left-radius": "14px",
        "padding-top": "11px",
        "padding-right": "13px",
        "padding-bottom": "11px",
        "padding-left": "13px",
        "margin-top": "0px",
        "margin-right": "0px",
        "margin-bottom": "14px",
        "margin-left": "0px",
        "font-size": "13px",
        "line-height": "1.5",
        "color": "#3B3527",
        "box-shadow": "rgba(40, 35, 20, 0.10) 0px 1px 2px"
      }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".wa-ventana__campo",
      "style": {
        "width": "100%",
        "border-style": "solid",
        "border-width": "1px",
        "border-color": "rgba(43,34,16,0.14)",
        "border-radius": "12px",
        "padding-top": "11px",
        "padding-right": "13px",
        "padding-bottom": "11px",
        "padding-left": "13px",
        "font-family": "Montserrat, sans-serif",
        "font-size": "13.5px",
        "line-height": "1.5",
        "resize": "vertical",
        "min-height": "88px",
        "background-color": "#FFFFFF",
        "color": "#2B2210"
      }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".wa-ventana__campo:focus",
      "style": { "outline-style": "solid", "outline-width": "2px", "outline-color": "rgba(205,162,60,0.55)", "outline-offset": "1px", "border-color": "transparent" }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".wa-ventana__consent",
      "style": {
        "display": "flex",
        "gap": "9px",
        "align-items": "flex-start",
        "margin-top": "12px",
        "margin-right": "0px",
        "margin-bottom": "0px",
        "margin-left": "0px",
        "font-size": "11.5px",
        "line-height": "1.45",
        "color": "#5C5545",
        "cursor": "pointer"
      }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".wa-ventana__casilla",
      "style": { "margin-top": "2px", "accent-color": "#CDA23C", "width": "15px", "height": "15px", "flex-grow": "0", "flex-shrink": "0" }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".wa-ventana__pie",
      "style": {
        "display": "flex",
        "align-items": "center",
        "gap": "10px",
        "padding-top": "12px",
        "padding-right": "16px",
        "padding-bottom": "12px",
        "padding-left": "16px",
        "background-color": "#FFFFFF",
        "border-top-style": "solid",
        "border-top-width": "1px",
        "border-top-color": "rgba(43,34,16,0.14)"
      }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".wa-ventana__nota",
      "style": { "flex-grow": "1", "font-size": "10.5px", "color": "#9A927F", "line-height": "1.4", "margin-top": "0px", "margin-right": "0px", "margin-bottom": "0px", "margin-left": "0px" }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".wa-ventana__enviar",
      "style": {
        "width": "46px",
        "height": "46px",
        "border-radius": "50%",
        "border-style": "none",
        "border-width": "0px",
        "background-color": "#25D366",
        "cursor": "pointer",
        "display": "flex",
        "align-items": "center",
        "justify-content": "center",
        "flex-grow": "0",
        "flex-shrink": "0",
        "transition": "transform .16s ease, background-color .16s ease"
      }
    },
    { "selector": ".wa-ventana__enviar:hover", "style": { "transform": "scale(1.06)" } },
    { "selector": ".wa-ventana__enviar[aria-disabled=\"true\"]", "style": { "background-color": "#CFCBC0", "cursor": "not-allowed", "transform": "none" } },
    {
      "selector": ".wa-ventana",
      "media": "(max-width: 720px)",
      "style": { "right": "12px", "bottom": "84px", "width": "calc(100vw - 24px)" }
    }
  ],
  "structure": [
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "classes": ["wa-ventana"],
      "attributes": {
        "id": "wa-ventana",
        "role": "dialog",
        "aria-label": "Escríbenos por WhatsApp",
        "data-cod-behavior": "wa-mensaje",
        "data-cod-wa-trigger": "a[href*=\"wa.me/\"]",
        "data-cod-wa-field": ".wa-ventana__hueco-campo",
        "data-cod-wa-consent": ".wa-ventana__hueco-casilla",
        "data-cod-wa-send": ".wa-ventana__enviar",
        "data-cod-wa-close": ".wa-ventana__cerrar",
        "data-cod-wa-open-class": "is-open",
        "data-cod-wa-placeholder": "Escribe tu pregunta…",
        "data-cod-wa-field-label": "Tu mensaje para Santa Luisa de Palpi",
        "data-cod-wa-consent-text": "Acepto recibir novedades de Santa Luisa de Palpi.",
        "data-cod-wa-event": "whatsapp_enviado"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "div",
          "classes": ["wa-ventana__cabecera"],
          "children": [
            { "tag": "div", "classes": ["wa-ventana__avatar"], "attributes": { "aria-hidden": "true" }, "text": "SL" },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "classes": ["wa-ventana__quien"],
              "children": [
                { "tag": "p", "classes": ["wa-ventana__nombre"], "text": "Santa Luisa de Palpi" },
                { "tag": "p", "classes": ["wa-ventana__estado"], "text": "Te respondemos por WhatsApp" }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tag": "button",
              "classes": ["wa-ventana__cerrar"],
              "attributes": { "type": "button", "aria-label": "Cerrar" },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "svg",
                  "attributes": { "viewBox": "0 0 24 24", "width": "17", "height": "17", "fill": "none", "stroke": "currentColor", "stroke-width": "2", "stroke-linecap": "round", "aria-hidden": "true" },
                  "children": [
                    { "tag": "path", "attributes": { "d": "M18 6 6 18" } },
                    { "tag": "path", "attributes": { "d": "M6 6l12 12" } }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "div",
          "classes": ["wa-ventana__cuerpo"],
          "children": [
            { "tag": "p", "classes": ["wa-ventana__saludo"], "text": "Hola 👋 Cuéntanos qué te gustaría saber y te respondemos por WhatsApp." },
            { "tag": "div", "classes": ["wa-ventana__hueco-campo"] },
            {
              "tag": "label",
              "classes": ["wa-ventana__consent"],
              "children": [
                { "tag": "span", "classes": ["wa-ventana__hueco-casilla"] },
                { "tag": "span", "text": "Quiero recibir novedades del proyecto por WhatsApp o correo." }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "div",
          "classes": ["wa-ventana__pie"],
          "children": [
            { "tag": "p", "classes": ["wa-ventana__nota"], "text": "Se abrirá WhatsApp con tu mensaje escrito. Puedes revisarlo antes de enviarlo." },
            {
              "tag": "button",
              "classes": ["wa-ventana__enviar"],
              "attributes": { "type": "button", "aria-label": "Enviar por WhatsApp" },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "svg",
                  "attributes": { "viewBox": "0 0 24 24", "width": "20", "height": "20", "fill": "#FFFFFF", "aria-hidden": "true" },
                  "children": [
                    { "tag": "path", "attributes": { "d": "M2.01 21 23 12 2.01 3 2 10l15 2-15 2z" } }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
